# GitHub Linguist Language Detection
# Highlights core frontend & backend web technologies

*.html linguist-detectable=true
*.css linguist-detectable=true
*.js linguist-detectable=true
*.py linguist-detectable=true

# Vendored files to exclude from language statistics
*.bat linguist-vendored
*.json linguist-vendored
*.yaml linguist-vendored
*.yml linguist-vendored
.agents/** linguist-vendored
